<section class="program-card program-editor"><h2>Your usual week · wake-up to sleep</h2><p>Build a routine in your timezone, then apply it to a selected week. Overnight sleep ends the next morning. This private plan does not create calendar invitations or change website availability.</p>
<details><summary>Edit weekly routine</summary><p>The example is a starting point. Set your actual habits and times before applying. Days: 1 Monday to 7 Sunday. Each line: <code>days | start | end | title | type</code>. Types: personal, focus, task, travel, project, meeting.</p><form method="post"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="routine_save"><input type="hidden" name="version" value="<?=(int)($routine['version']??0)?>"><label>Routine timezone<select name="timezone"><?php foreach(DateTimeZone::listIdentifiers()as$tz):?><option <?=$tz===($routine['timezone']??$prefs['timezone'])?'selected':''?>><?=e($tz)?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><label>Weekly routine<textarea name="routine" rows="16" maxlength="18000" required><?=e($routine['text']??$routineDefault)?></textarea></label><button class="wbtn">Save routine template</button></form></details>
